[00:03.620]よ！　じゃ　いくぞ！
{"好！　那么　开始吧！"}
[00:06.084]ジャン　ケン　ポン！
{"剪刀　石头　布！"}
[00:30.117]They tell me keep it simple
{"他们让我保持简单"}
[00:31.438]I tell them take it slow
{"我告诉他们慢慢来"}
[00:32.876]I feed and water an idea so I let it grow
{"我精心培育一个想法 让它自然生长"}
[00:35.594]I tell them take it easy
{"我告诉他们放轻松"}
[00:36.859]they laugh and tell me no
{"他们笑着拒绝我"}
[00:38.353]It's cool but I don't see them laughing at my money though
{"无所谓 反正他们可不敢嘲笑我的财富"}
[00:41.049]They spittin' facts at me,
{"他们对我指手画脚"}
[00:42.396]I'm spittin' tracks, catch me?
{"我用音乐回敬 接得住吗"}
[00:43.809]I'm spinning gold out my records know you can't combat me
{"我的唱片点石成金 你根本无力抗衡"}
[00:46.426]They tell me Jesus walks
{"他们说耶稣在人间行走"}
[00:47.900]I tell them money talks
{"我说金钱才掌握话语权"}
[00:49.071]Bling got me chill
{"珠宝让我冷静"}
[00:50.082]cause I'm living in an icebox
{"因为我活在冰窖般的世界"}
[00:51.984]They tell me I've been sleepin'
{"他们说我在沉睡"}
[00:53.332]I say I'm wide awake
{"我说我清醒得很"}
[00:54.583]Tracks hot and ready so they call me mister e-z bake
{"作品火热出炉 他们都叫我快手先生"}
[00:57.456]They say the grass is greener
{"他们说别处草更绿"}
[00:58.826]I think my grass is dank
{"我觉得自家草坪够劲"}
[01:00.020]Drivin' with a drank on an empty tank to the bank
{"喝着酒 空着油箱 照样开向银行"}
[01:03.054]Do you feel me?
{"懂我意思吗"}
[01:03.799]Take a look inside my brain
{"看看我的脑海"}
[01:05.333]The people always different but it always feels the same
{"面孔总在变换 但感觉始终如一"}
[01:08.509]That's the real me
{"那才是真实的我"}
[01:09.360]Pop the champagne
{"开启香槟"}
[01:10.739]The haters wanna hurt me
{"那些黑子想伤害我"}
[01:11.930]and I'm laughin' at the pain
{"而我笑对伤痛"}
[01:14.124]Stayin' still, eyes closed
{"静立原地　闭目凝神"}
[01:16.493]Let the world just pass me by
{"任世界从身旁流逝"}
[01:19.563]Pain pills, nice clothes
{"止痛药丸　华服加身"}
[01:21.795]If I fall I think I'll fly
{"若我坠落　或许能翱翔"}
[01:25.011]Touch me, Midas
{"触碰我吧　点金之手"}
[01:27.431]Make me part of your design
{"让我成为你蓝图的一部分"}
[01:30.490]None to guide us
{"无人指引我们"}
[01:32.716]I feel fear for the very last time
{"这是我最后一次感受恐惧"}
[01:57.415]They tell me that I'm special
{"他们说我很特别"}
[01:58.771]I smile and shake my head
{"我微笑摇头"}
[02:00.185]I'll give them stories to tell friends about the things I said
{"我会给他们些谈资　好向朋友转述我的狂言"}
[02:02.903]They tell me I'm so humble,
{"他们夸我如此谦逊"}
[02:04.258]I say I'm turning red
{"我说我羞红了脸"}
[02:05.635]They let me lie to them and don't feel like they've been misled
{"他们放任我撒谎　却不觉被欺骗"}
[02:08.354]They give so much to me
{"他们给予我太多"}
[02:09.655]I'm losing touch get me?
{"我逐渐迷失　懂吗"}
[02:11.071]Served on a silver platter
{"银盘盛来的馈赠"}
[02:12.120]ask for seconds they just let me
{"索取更多　他们也纵容"}
[02:13.843]They tell me I'm a god,
{"他们尊我为神祇"}
[02:15.167]I'm lost in the façade
{"我却迷失在表象里"}
[02:16.344]Six feet off the ground at all times
{"双脚始终离地三尺"}
[02:18.012]I think I'm feelin' odd
{"我想我有些不对劲"}
[02:19.405]No matter what I make
{"无论我创造什么"}
[02:20.613]they never see mistakes
{"他们永远看不见瑕疵"}
[02:21.807]Makin' so much bread
{"赚得盆满钵满"}
[02:22.810]I don't care that they're just being fake
{"我不在乎他们虚情假意"}
[02:24.699]They tell me they're below me
{"他们说在我之下"}
[02:26.083]I act like I'm above
{"我表现得高高在上"}
[02:27.251]The people blend together but I would be lost without their love
{"人群交融难辨 但若失去他们的爱我将迷失方向"}
[02:30.317]Can you heal me?
{"你能治愈我吗"}
[02:31.001]Have I gained too much?
{"我是否得到太多"}
[02:32.560]When you become untouchable you're unable to touch
{"当你变得不可触碰 便也无法触碰他人"}
[02:35.767]Is there a real me?
{"真实的我存在吗"}
[02:36.642]Pop the champagne
{"打开香槟吧"}
[02:38.006]It hurts me just to think and I don't do pain
{"光是思考就让我痛苦 而我拒绝承受疼痛"}
[02:41.369]Stayin' still, eyes closed
{"静止不动 紧闭双眼"}
[02:43.770]Let the world just pass me by
{"任由世界从我身旁流逝"}
[02:46.837]Pain pills, nice clothes
{"止痛药 华服加身"}
[02:49.214]If I fall I think I'll fly
{"若我坠落 或许会翱翔"}
[02:52.298]Touch me, Midas
{"触碰我吧 迈达斯"}
[02:54.692]Make me part of your design
{"让我成为你设计的一部分"}
[02:57.760]None to guide us
{"无人指引我们"}
[03:00.097]I feel fear for the very last time
{"最后一次感受恐惧"}
[03:03.200]Lay still, restless
{"躺着不动 心绪不宁"}
[03:05.566]Losing sleep while I lose my mind
{"失眠之际逐渐疯狂"}
[03:08.685]All thrill, no stress
{"全是刺激 没有压力"}
[03:11.019]All my muses left behind
{"所有灵感缪斯都被遗弃"}
[03:14.114]World is below
{"世界在脚下"}
[03:16.448]So high up, I'm near divine
{"凌绝顶　近神明"}
[03:19.554]Lean in, let go
{"倾身　放手"}
[03:21.812]I feel fear for the very last time
{"最后一次感受恐惧"}
